
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Rithick Paul's personal portfolio - aspiring software developer, programmer and hackathon enthusiast.">
    <title>Rithick Paul | Portfolio</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css">
    <script src="./script.js" defer></script>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- NAVIGATION -->
    <header class="navbar">
        <nav class="nav-container">
            <a href="#home" class="logo">Rithick<span>.</span></a>

            <button class="menu-toggle" id="menu-toggle"
                    aria-label="Toggle navigation menu">
                ☰
            </button>

            <ul class="nav-links" id="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About Me</a></li>
                <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
                <li><a href="#projects">Project Details</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>


    <!-- HOME / HERO -->
    <main>

        <section class="hero section" id="home">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <p class="hero-greeting">HELLO, WORLD! 👋</p>

                <h1>
                    I'm <span class="gradient-text">Rithick Paul</span>
                </h1>

                <h2 class="typing-heading">
                    <span id="typing-text">Aspiring Software Developer</span>
                    <span class="typing-cursor">|</span>
                </h2>

                <p class="hero-description">
                    I enjoy building software, solving problems and exploring
                    new technologies. I'm constantly learning and turning
                    creative ideas into practical solutions.
                </p>

                <div class="hero-buttons">
                    <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">
                        Explore My Work
                    </a>

                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-secondary">
                        Contact Me
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="social-links">
                    <a href="https://github.com/rithickpaul"
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        GitHub ↗
                    </a>

                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/"
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        LinkedIn ↗
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-card">
                <div class="code-window">
                    <div class="window-header">
                        <span></span>
                        <span></span>
                        <span></span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="code-content">
                        <p><span class="code-purple">class</span> Developer:</p>
                        <p class="indent">
                            name = <span class="code-green">"Rithick"</span>
                        </p>
                        <p class="indent">
                            skills = [
                        </p>
                        <p class="indent2">
                            <span class="code-green">"Python"</span>,
                            <span class="code-green">"Java"</span>,
                        </p>
                        <p class="indent2">
                            <span class="code-green">"C/C++"</span>,
                            <span class="code-green">"Web"</span>
                        </p>
                        <p class="indent">
                            ]
                        </p>
                        <p class="indent">
                            passion = <span class="code-green">"Building"</span>
                        </p>
                        <br>
                        <p>
                            <span class="code-purple">print</span>
                            (<span class="code-green">"Hello, World!"</span>)
                        </p>
                        <p class="code-comment">
                            # Always learning something new
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- ABOUT -->
        <section class="section about-section" id="about">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <p class="section-label">GET TO KNOW ME</p>
                <h2>About <span class="gradient-text">Me</span></h2>
                <p>A little introduction about myself.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-card">
                <h3>Who am I?</h3>

                <p>
                    I'm Rithick Paul, an aspiring software developer
                    passionate about programming, technology and innovation.
                    I enjoy learning different programming languages,
                    understanding how things work and creating useful
                    applications.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I have explored programming with C, C++, Python and Java,
                    along with web development. I also enjoy participating
                    in hackathons because they challenge me to think
                    creatively, collaborate and build solutions.
                </p>

                <p>
                    My goal is to keep improving my technical skills and
                    become a developer who builds meaningful software.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- SKILLS -->
        <section class="section" id="skills">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <p class="section-label">WHAT I WORK WITH</p>
                <h2>My <span class="gradient-text">Skills</span></h2>
                <p>Technologies and languages I'm learning and using.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="skills-grid">

                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">C</div>
                    <h3>C Programming</h3>
                    <p>Programming fundamentals and logic building.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">C++</div>
                    <h3>C++</h3>
                    <p>Problem solving and object-oriented programming.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">🐍</div>
                    <h3>Python</h3>
                    <p>Programming, automation and application development.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">☕</div>
                    <h3>Java</h3>
                    <p>Object-oriented programming and application logic.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">🌐</div>
                    <h3>HTML & CSS</h3>
                    <p>Building and styling responsive websites.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="skill-card">
                    <div class="skill-icon">JS</div>
                    <h3>JavaScript</h3>
                    <p>Adding interactivity to web applications.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- PROJECTS -->
        <section class="section" id="projects">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <p class="section-label">MY WORK</p>
                <h2>Project <span class="gradient-text">Details</span></h2>
                <p>Some projects and ideas I've worked on.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="projects-grid">

                <article class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-number">01</div>

                    <h3>Speed Demon</h3>

                    <p>
                        A high-performance log ingestion and processing
                        project designed to process millions of structured
                        log records efficiently.
                    </p>

                    <div class="tech-tags">
                        <span>C++</span>
                        <span>Docker</span>
                        <span>Performance</span>
                    </div>

                    <a href="https://github.com/rithickpaul/speed-demon-ingest"
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                       class="project-link">
                        View Project ↗
                    </a>
                </article>


                <article class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-number">02</div>

                    <h3>TerraGuard AI</h3>

                    <p>
                        A hackathon project concept focused on using
                        intelligent drone-based delivery solutions
                        to improve medical supply distribution.
                    </p>

                    <div class="tech-tags">
                        <span>AI</span>
                        <span>Drones</span>
                        <span>Innovation</span>
                    </div>

                    <a href="#contact" class="project-link">
                        Learn More ↗
                    </a>
                </article>


                <article class="project-card">
                    <div class="project-number">03</div>

                    <h3>Personal Portfolio</h3>

                    <p>
                        My personal portfolio website showcasing my
                        skills, projects, learning journey and
                        interests in software development.
                    </p>

                    <div class="tech-tags">
                        <span>HTML</span>
                        <span>CSS</span>
                        <span>JavaScript</span>
                    </div>

                    <a href="https://github.com/rithickpaul/my-portfolio"
                       target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                       class="project-link">
                        View Source ↗
                    </a>
                </article>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- CONTACT -->
        <section class="section contact-section" id="contact">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <p class="section-label">LET'S CONNECT</p>
                <h2>Contact <span class="gradient-text">Me</span></h2>
                <p>Have an idea, opportunity or project? Let's connect.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="contact-card">
                <h3>Let's build something together!</h3>

                <p>
                    I'm always interested in learning, collaborating
                    and exploring new opportunities.
                </p>

                <div class="contact-details">
                    <p>
                        <strong>Email:</strong>
                        <a href="mailto:rithickpaul@gmail.com">
                            rithickpaul@gmail.com
                        </a>
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <strong>GitHub:</strong>
                        <a href="https://github.com/rithickpaul"
                           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            github.com/rithickpaul
                        </a>
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <strong>LinkedIn:</strong>
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/"
                           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                            Connect on LinkedIn
                        </a>
                    </p>
                </div>

                <a href="mailto:rithickpaul@gmail.com"
                   class="btn btn-primary">
                    Say Hello ✉
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <p>
            Designed and built by
            <span class="gradient-text">Rithick Paul</span>
        </p>

        <p>© <span id="year"></span> All rights reserved.</p>

        <a href="#home" class="back-to-top">Back to top ↑</a>
    </footer>

